{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KQFDXupLF4jdATzY1nGhSF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## US-002: Framework Renderer Interface\n\n### New Files\n- **`assets/renderer.ts`** — The `FrameworkRenderer<TApp>` interface contract with 6 required methods (`name`, `mount`, `updateProps`, `patchProps`, `updateSlots`, `unmount`) and 1 optional (`renderToString`). Also defines `RendererState`, `MountContext`, and `SSRContext` types.\n- **`assets/renderers/vue.ts`** — Reference Vue implementation (`createVueRenderer()`) that wraps all Vue-specific concerns: `reactive()` for props, `h()` for slot rendering, `createApp`/`createSSRApp` for mounting, `app.unmount()` for cleanup.\n- **`assets/renderer.test.ts`** — 13 tests covering the hook+renderer integration with a mock renderer\n- **`assets/renderers/vue.test.ts`** — 11 tests covering the Vue renderer implementation\n\n### Modified Files\n- **`assets/hooks.ts`** — Added `getRendererHook(renderer, resolve)` — the framework-agnostic hook factory that delegates all framework operations to a `FrameworkRenderer`. The existing `getVueHook` is preserved unchanged for backward compatibility.\n- **`assets/server.ts`** — Added `getRendererRender(renderer, resolve)` for framework-agnostic SSR. The existing `getRender` is preserved.\n- **`assets/index.ts`** — Exports the new types (`FrameworkRenderer`, `RendererState`, `MountContext`, `SSRContext`), the Vue renderer (`createVueRenderer`), and `getRendererHook`.\n\n### Design Decisions\n- **Slots as raw HTML strings** in the renderer interface — each framework converts to its own format (Vue uses `h(\"div\", { innerHTML })`, React would use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, etc.)\n- **Props as plain objects** — the renderer wraps them in its reactivity system (`reactive()` for Vue, `useState` for React, etc.)\n- **JSON Patch operates on the renderer's reactive props** — this works because `applyPatch` mutates in-place, which triggers Vue's reactive tracking\n- **Full backward compatibility** — all existing Vue APIs (`getVueHook`, `getHooks`, `getRender`, `createLiveVite`) continue to work unchanged\n\n### All 245 tests pass (0 regressions, 24 new tests).\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":432,"cache_read_input_tokens":84987,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":432},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7614b6c-f448-43a7-8572-6bc7e0743cbe","uuid":"05641985-adb5-470f-bfd4-ca4a269eb23a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":412630,"duration_api_ms":403348,"num_turns":46,"result":"Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## US-002: Framework Renderer Interface\n\n### New Files\n- **`assets/renderer.ts`** — The `FrameworkRenderer<TApp>` interface contract with 6 required methods (`name`, `mount`, `updateProps`, `patchProps`, `updateSlots`, `unmount`) and 1 optional (`renderToString`). Also defines `RendererState`, `MountContext`, and `SSRContext` types.\n- **`assets/renderers/vue.ts`** — Reference Vue implementation (`createVueRenderer()`) that wraps all Vue-specific concerns: `reactive()` for props, `h()` for slot rendering, `createApp`/`createSSRApp` for mounting, `app.unmount()` for cleanup.\n- **`assets/renderer.test.ts`** — 13 tests covering the hook+renderer integration with a mock renderer\n- **`assets/renderers/vue.test.ts`** — 11 tests covering the Vue renderer implementation\n\n### Modified Files\n- **`assets/hooks.ts`** — Added `getRendererHook(renderer, resolve)` — the framework-agnostic hook factory that delegates all framework operations to a `FrameworkRenderer`. The existing `getVueHook` is preserved unchanged for backward compatibility.\n- **`assets/server.ts`** — Added `getRendererRender(renderer, resolve)` for framework-agnostic SSR. The existing `getRender` is preserved.\n- **`assets/index.ts`** — Exports the new types (`FrameworkRenderer`, `RendererState`, `MountContext`, `SSRContext`), the Vue renderer (`createVueRenderer`), and `getRendererHook`.\n\n### Design Decisions\n- **Slots as raw HTML strings** in the renderer interface — each framework converts to its own format (Vue uses `h(\"div\", { innerHTML })`, React would use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, etc.)\n- **Props as plain objects** — the renderer wraps them in its reactivity system (`reactive()` for Vue, `useState` for React, etc.)\n- **JSON Patch operates on the renderer's reactive props** — this works because `applyPatch` mutates in-place, which triggers Vue's reactive tracking\n- **Full backward compatibility** — all existing Vue APIs (`getVueHook`, `getHooks`, `getRender`, `createLiveVite`) continue to work unchanged\n\n### All 245 tests pass (0 regressions, 24 new tests).\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"f7614b6c-f448-43a7-8572-6bc7e0743cbe","total_cost_usd":2.2656940500000005,"usage":{"input_tokens":1160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69947,"cache_read_input_tokens":2373594,"output_tokens":21140,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69947,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0}},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1160,"outputTokens":21140,"cacheReadInputTokens":2373594,"cacheCreationInputTokens":69947,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.15826575,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12831,"outputTokens":4475,"cacheReadInputTokens":209098,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41050,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1074283,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"b297094d-67fb-410e-abd9-4fbd93e3916a"}

